"type": "heading"}, {"content": "Notez l'emploi de l'imparfait et du pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9 dans le r\u00e9cit de Charlotte. Le pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9 raconte les \u00e9v\u00e9nements et l'imparfait d\u00e9crit les circonstances.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Le soutien pour l'id\u00e9ologie L\u00e9nine <span class=\"strong\">grandissait</span> et le peuple <span class=\"strong\"> a</span> finalement <span class=\"strong\"> renvers\u00e9</span> le r\u00e9gime.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "La Russie <span class=\"strong\">a vu</span> acc\u00e9der au pouvoir un gouvernement communiste.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le communiste, la communiste", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personne qui croit en ou soutient le communisme ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les communistes ont pris le pouvoir en 1917.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous pouvez employer pour parler de l'histoire.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le partisan, la partisane ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personne qui est attach\u00e9e \u00e0 une cause", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les partisans du r\u00e9gime tsariste ont r\u00e9sist\u00e9. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'ouvrier, l'ouvri\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "travailleur manuel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les ouvriers travaillaient m\u00eame le dimanche.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le paysan, la paysanne", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personne de la campagne qui vit du travail de la terre", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils ont donn\u00e9 aux paysans ce qui leur appartenait, la terre.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l\u00e9gitime ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "l\u00e9gal ; justifi\u00e9 ; justifiable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le peuple a des demandes absolument l\u00e9gitimes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bolchevik ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "communiste russe", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les bolcheviks ont assassin\u00e9 le Tsar et sa famille.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "prendre possession de", "type": "name"}, {"content": "s'accorder la possession de ; s'accaparer ; s'emparer de quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(locution)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les soviets ont pris possession des usines. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le soutien", "type": "name"}, {"content": "acte de soutenir quelque chose ; un appui", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le soutien pour l'id\u00e9ologie L\u00e9nine grandissait.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "accorder", "type": "name"}, {"content": "donner officiellement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils ont accord\u00e9 le droit de vote aux femmes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "prendre le pouvoir", "type": "name"}, {"content": "acc\u00e9der au pouvoir ; s'emparer du pouvoir politique", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Apr\u00e8s la r\u00e9volution, les militaires ont pris le pouvoir dans le pays.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob08aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Mots de liaison", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Les mots de liaison sont aussi appel\u00e9s connecteurs. Ils servent \u00e0 relier des propositions, des phrases ou des paragraphes. Ils assurent  la coh\u00e9sion et la coh\u00e9rence d'un texte.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">D'abord</span>, les gens \u00e9taient m\u00e9contents. <span class=\"strong\">Ensuite</span>, un leader est apparu pour diriger le mouvement populaire. <span class=\"strong\">Ainsi</span>,  la r\u00e9volution a r\u00e9ussi. <span class=\"strong\">Cependant</span>, les r\u00e9sultats n'ont pas \u00e9t\u00e9 tout \u00e0 fait au go\u00fbt des r\u00e9volutionnaires.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Ces connecteurs accomplissent diff\u00e9rents types de relation :    ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>d'\u00e9num\u00e9ration (d'abord, ensuite, pour finir\u2026)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>de cause (car, \u00e0 cause de, en effet\u2026)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>d'opposition (en revanche, par contre\u2026)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>de concession (pourtant, toutefois, cependant\u2026)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>de cons\u00e9quence (par cons\u00e9quent, ainsi, donc\u2026)", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Allez sur Internet et faites une recherche sur un \u00e9v\u00e9nement historique ou un festival culturel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez un court paragraphe.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Employez les phrases au pass\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez votre paragraphe \u00e0 votre camarade ou \u00e0 un membre de votre famille.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je fais une recherche sur un \u00e9v\u00e9nement ou un festival.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris des phrases au pass\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9change des informations sur l'histoire d'un pays.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux \u00e9crire un paragraphe court.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux rapporter des informations sur des choses, des actions, des \u00e9v\u00e9nements et des personnes au pass\u00e9.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux \u00e9crire sur l'histoire.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Que savez-vous sur l'histoire russe contemporaine ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Savez-vous qui \u00e9tait L\u00e9nine et quelle est son importance pour la Russie et le monde entier ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin r\u00e9daction : L'histoire de Moscou. ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Charlotte d\u00e9cide d'assister \u00e0 une s\u00e9ance de lecture \u00e0 la biblioth\u00e8que municipale de Moscou. Elle \u00e9coute un <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">extrait</span> sur la R\u00e9volution de 1917.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [{"content": "Un <span class=\"italic\">extrait</span> est une partie tir\u00e9e d'un texte plus long.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Appuyez sur le bouton pour \u00e9couter l'enregistrement audio.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "STI", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [3], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Au mois de novembre de l'ann\u00e9e 1917, suite \u00e0 une r\u00e9volution ouvri\u00e8re, la Russie a vu acc\u00e9der au pouvoir un gouvernement communiste.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "\u00c0 la t\u00eate du mouvement, un d\u00e9nomm\u00e9 Vladimir Ilitch Oulianov, dit L\u00e9nine, a su s\u00e9duire les masses populaires et les ouvriers avec des slogans comme \u00ab la paix, le pain, la terre \u00bb.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Sa premi\u00e8re promesse aux Russes \u00e9tait de sortir la Russie de la destructrice Premi\u00e8re Guerre mondiale.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 2}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Il disait aussi qu'il allait accorder aux paysans des terres autrefois dans les mains des propri\u00e9taires terriens et des aristocrates.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 3}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Ainsi, le soutien pour l'id\u00e9ologie L\u00e9nine grandissait et le peuple a finalement renvers\u00e9 le r\u00e9gime des tsars pour le remplacer par un r\u00e9gime communiste dans l'espoir d'une meilleure vie.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 4}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "\u00c0 la fin, c'\u00e9tait les conseils de d\u00e9l\u00e9gu\u00e9s ouvriers, connus sous le nom de \u00ab soviet \u00bb qui ont pris possession des terres agricoles et des usines, et une guerre civile a \u00e9clat\u00e9 entre les partisans des communistes, les bolchevistes, et les tsaristes.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 5}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Savez-vous comment organiser un paragraphe de fa\u00e7on coh\u00e9rente ?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": " Parfait !", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Quelque chose ne va pas. Essayez encore une fois !", "type": "text"}, {"content": "La prochaine fois peut-\u00eatre. ", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Regardez l'enregistrement vid\u00e9o. D\u00e9placez les phrases verticalement <span class=\"sena-icon sena-icon-vertical-drag\"></span> pour les mettre dans l'ordre chronologique.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Vous avez deux essais pour soumettre vos r\u00e9ponses.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": 2, "type": "template_override"}], "type": "MT1", "template_override": 2}, {"id": 3, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"co